	(text "Simple docking station for TT ASIC DIPs.\n\nProvides the same form factor and interface--piano DIP and 7-segment, \nmanual clock and reset, pmod connectors--as the Tiny Tapeout \ndemoboard for GF DIP breakouts.\n\nPop in the DIP, with the USB connector side facing the pmods, plug \ninto computer/USB power supply (or power using connectors on left), \nand go."
